        defense: [E(.statement, 1, "Paddle", "{DL} says {V} swung a bidder paddle.")],
        role: "Auctioneer",
        exam: [.direct("What happened in the sale barn?", "\"{V}, a ranch hand, was stabbed in the side after a bidding dispute. I was the auctioneer, and I saw {D} with the knife.\""), .direct("What did deputies find?", "\"A pocket knife with blood on it, and {V} with a deep side wound. The medical report confirms it.\""), .direct("What had the dispute been about?", "\"Bidding. {D} had bid against {V} all day, and tempers rose as the sale went on.\""), .direct("What happened at the sale barn that afternoon?", "\"The sale was in full swing at about one with a big crowd in the bleachers and cattle in the ring. Two bidders kept raising each other on a string of heifers.\""), .direct("What did you see during the fight?", "\"Around 1:30, {D} and {V} squared off in the aisle, and {V} took a swing with something in a hand. Then {D} lunged and {V} dropped.\""), .direct("What did {D} have in hand?", "\"A pocket knife. I saw the blade after {V} fell and I heard someone yell that {V} was bleeding.\""), .cross("{D} says {V} swung a bidder paddle, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"A paddle was raised. A ring worker says {V} raised it, and I will say that I saw it lifted.\""), .cross("Did {V} strike {D} with the paddle?", "\"I cannot say. I did not see it come down.\""), .cross("Was the paddle damaged?", "\"It had a split edge. I noticed that afterward.\""), .cross("{V} had a bidder paddle, didn't {V.he}?", "\"Yes, a wooden paddle with a split edge. I cannot say whether {V} swung it.\""), .cross("The two had bid against each other all day, hadn't they?", "\"Yes, in a heated series. I have seen that kind of rivalry before.\"")],
        defenseRole: "Ring man",
        defenseExam: [.direct("What did you see in the sale barn?", "\"I saw {V} raise a bidder paddle toward {D} during the argument. It was quick, and then the knife came out.\""), .direct("Did {V} swing the paddle at {D}?", "\"Maybe. It looked like a swing to me, but I was across the ring, and it all happened fast.\""), .direct("What did {D} do right after the paddle came up?", "\"{D} stepped back and used the knife. I saw it in {D}'s hand, and then {V} was holding {V.his} side.\""), .direct("What is your role at the sale?", "\"I work the ring spotting bids and keeping order among the buyers. I was about ten feet away when it started.\""), .direct("What did you see between them?", "\"A shouting match that got physical. {V} swung something that looked like a paddle.\""), .direct("What happened after?", "\"{D} stabbed once and stepped back, looking stunned. The ring crew rushed in and called an ambulance right away.\""), .cross("Did you see the paddle hit {D}?", "\"No. I did not see it hit. I saw it raised, and then the knife.\""), .cross("How far were you from the two of them?", "\"About twenty feet. I had a decent view, but the crowd was in the way for part of it.\""), .cross("Did {D} bid against {V} all day?", "\"Yes. They were competing on the same lots. It was a sore point between them.\""), .cross("You did not see the first swing, did you?", "\"I saw {V}'s arm go up. I did not see the paddle land.\""), .cross("Both of them were angry, weren't they?", "\"Yes. It was a heated day.\"")],
