        closings: ("Look-alike tablets in six bottles, failed counts on {D}'s shifts, and {D} alone at the counter. The pharmacy's own records point to one technician.", "A counter ticketed for calibration problems and no witness to any swap. The State must prove {D} put those tablets in the bottles."),
