        defenseRole: "Former houseguest",
        defenseExam: [.direct("How do you know {D}?", "\"I stayed at {D}'s home for several weeks last year when I needed somewhere to live. We are friends from school.\""), .direct("Did you use {D}'s network?", "\"Yes. {D} gave me the Wi-Fi password and let me use an old phone when mine broke.\""), .direct("Did you post reviews or messages about {V}?", "\"I'd rather not go into what I did online. I did not target {V} in any way I am willing to describe here.\""), .direct("When did you leave {D}'s home?", "\"About a month before the warrant. I moved in with a relative across town, and I have not used that Wi-Fi since.\""), .direct("Did {D} know what you were doing online?", "\"No. {D} never looked at my phone and never asked what I was doing online. We lived mostly separate lives in the same apartment.\""), .direct("Why are you here?", "\"Because {D} is being blamed for something that happened in {D}'s house while I was there.\""), .cross("Did you write the posts?", "\"I am not going to answer questions that could incriminate me, and I would ask the court to let me decline that one.\""), .cross("Did you use {D}'s phone?", "\"Yes, often. It was an old phone {D} lent me when mine broke, and it had my own accounts signed in on it.\""), .cross("Did {D} ever use that phone?", "\"Occasionally {D} picked it up to move it or charge it, but mostly I was the one using it, day and night.\""), .cross("Did {D} know {V}?", "\"I think so. I heard {D} mention {V} a couple of times in conversation, though not in a way that sounded hostile to me.\""), .cross("Did you speak to deputies?", "\"Briefly. They asked me about the network and who had used it, and I told them what I was willing to say.\"")],
